    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/33cb9e8f0c73549e52c9e9d4de2f4de1.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/e3a60aed05acbe6f249883c3e0925caa.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll play as a regular guy who gets accepted and granted a scholarship to an elite, mysterious residential college. Everything seems too good to be true \u2013 and it is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/a6dc16912e9801833b7b30e7a6b32f76.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/74faae7f310ecce17ab42a525e7f3346.poster.avif?t=1754824115\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/74faae7f310ecce17ab42a525e7f3346.webm?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/74faae7f310ecce17ab42a525e7f3346.mp4?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Everyone\u2019s trying to assure you to stop paying attention to her since she\u2019s \u201ccrazy\u201d, but as the Initiation Feast\u2019s getting closer, and you explore the school, you begin to understand a terrifying truth:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/71789fd9648e1400d7c001d6173362e3.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll get to know a lot of enigmatic sexy girls - from Lenor, the deranged cultist who believes you're her divine chosen one, to rebellious fun-seeking werewolf Eila and cold-hearted dominant bitch Triss, who\u2019ll rather die than submit or obey to someone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/1e1a4ceb7e56cbfddeef6d1f48a90fb4.poster.avif?t=1754824115\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/1e1a4ceb7e56cbfddeef6d1f48a90fb4.webm?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/1e1a4ceb7e56cbfddeef6d1f48a90fb4.mp4?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/c994b8a733ed4ecef5605ca963740dc5.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/973430e7a7a189746ec3653518429774.poster.avif?t=1754824115\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/973430e7a7a189746ec3653518429774.webm?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/973430e7a7a189746ec3653518429774.mp4?t=1754824115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/4da10db45dfe33d8ab23b5ff17a58d07.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices affect the journey through a dangerous academy of seductive vampires, deadly rituals and power plays - see if you can survive the night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/45d537dd23e2b168f362e901191f6540.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=150 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot 18+ content  \u2013 enjoy adult scenes with dangerous and seductive vampires as you explore their bodies and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gothic vibes \u2013 explore a dark and enigmatic academy filled with danger, mystery, vampires, werewolves and their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suspenseful plot  \u2013 uncover the secrets of this dark place and shape the story with your choices - are you a prey or a predator?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings  \u2013 every choice matters, leading to different outcomes and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven narrative  \u2013 develop relationships with four unique main characters, each with their own desires and deadly intentions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest system \u2013 complete various tasks while navigating through the story and trying to turn the situation in your favor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172270/extras/89328d9bba30f8a1f3de53c7692f9b6c.avif?t=1754824115\" width=599 height=200 /></span></p></li></ul>",
